verses.text:
You have given us your partnership.
It was not that you were lacking anything from us;
it was we who were lacking you.

For a stream went out and became a great and wide river;
it swept away everything, broke it up,
and brought it to the Temple.{a}

As anger rushes at wrongdoing,
so joy rushes to the beloved,
and brings in its fruits without holding back.{a}

For he set his path toward knowledge;
he made it wide and made it long,
and brought it to complete fullness.

I formed their limbs;
my own breasts I made ready for them,
so that they could drink my holy milk, and live on it.

For their writing is the victory that is yours;
and she sees you before her,
and wants you to be redeemed. Hallelujah.

And the nations that were scattered were gathered together;
and I was not made unclean by my sins,{a}
because they praised me in the high places.

My heart was circumcised, and its blossom appeared;
and goodness sprang up in it,
and it bore fruit for the Lord.

He is my sun;
his rays have lifted me up,
and his light has driven all darkness from my face.

My craft and my service are in his praises,
for his love has fed my heart,
and his fruits have gushed up to my lips.

Let your right hand set up victory
for our salvation. Receive us from every place,
and guard everyone who is held fast by evils.{a}
